<Base title="Japanese Foundations — Start Here" description="Begin Japanese with a clear, guided introduction to the writing systems, before studying hiragana and katakana." breadcrumbs={[{label:'Courses',href:'/learn/'},{label:'Japanese Foundations',href:'/learn/start/'}]}>
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><a href="/learn/">Courses</a><span>›</span><span>Start here</span></nav><span class="eyebrow">LEVEL 0 · JAPANESE FOUNDATIONS</span><h1>Start with the big picture.</h1><p>New to Japanese? First learn how the language is written. Then you can approach hiragana and katakana with confidence.</p></div></section>
  <section class="page-body"><div class="container foundation-index"><div class="course-notice"><strong>Start learning today.</strong> Chapter 01 lessons 01–08 and its checkpoint, plus Chapter 02 lessons 01–08 and its checkpoint, are published and free to study. More Foundations lessons are in development.</div><span class="eyebrow">MODULE 01 · GETTING ORIENTED</span><h2>Understand the writing systems</h2><p>Learn how the scripts fit together before memorizing characters. The lesson includes explanations, original examples, an interactive check, and progress saving.</p><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">LESSON 01 · ABOUT 12 MIN</span><h3>Japanese writing: a map of four systems</h3><p>Hiragana, katakana, kanji and romaji—learn what each is for.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-01/lesson-01/">Study lesson 01 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">LESSON 02 · ABOUT 22 MIN</span><h3>Japanese classroom words: read, ask, and recognize</h3><p>Script names, classroom expressions, readings versus meanings, flashcards, and interactive practice.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-01/lesson-02/">Study lesson 02 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">LESSON 03 · ABOUT 26 MIN</span><h3>How Japanese sentences work: scripts, particles and verb-final order</h3><p>Recognize は and を, the typical verb-final pattern, and polite sentence endings.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-01/lesson-03/">Study lesson 03 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">LESSON 04 · ABOUT 27 MIN</span><h3>Recognize and type your first kana</h3><p>Five hiragana/katakana vowel pairs, classroom examples, keyboard entry, and optional tracing.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-01/lesson-04/">Study lesson 04 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">LESSON 05 · ABOUT 25 MIN</span><h3>Read a Japanese script-identification chart</h3><p>Scan nine original classroom examples, locate explicit details and quote the evidence in twelve interactive questions.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-01/lesson-05/">Study lesson 05 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">LESSON 06 · ABOUT 25 MIN</span><h3>Listen to a Japanese writing-systems overview</h3><p>Two original narrated Japanese tracks, transcript-free listening, eight interactive checks and guided review.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-01/lesson-06/">Study lesson 06 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">LESSON 07 · ABOUT 30 MIN</span><h3>Write and type your first Japanese script labels</h3><p>Produce kana and familiar words, build two short Japanese labels, then revise a four-script explanation against a self-review rubric.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-01/lesson-07/">Study lesson 07 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">LESSON 08 · ABOUT 25 MIN</span><h3>Speak and shadow Japanese writing-system explanations</h3><p>Rehearse real Japanese model audio, try five phrase-choice checks and optionally record privately for self-review.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-01/lesson-08/">Study lesson 08 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 01 CHECKPOINT · ABOUT 40 MIN</span><h3>Japanese language map — mixed checkpoint</h3><p>Sixteen new script, sentence, chart-reading and real-audio questions with detailed feedback and optional writing self-review.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-01/checkpoint/">Take Chapter 01 checkpoint ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 02 · LESSON 01 · ABOUT 24 MIN</span><h3>Five Japanese vowels and mora timing</h3><p>Meet a beginner classroom scene, explore あ・い・う・え・お and count written rhythm units in ten interactive questions.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-02/lesson-01/">Study Chapter 02 lesson 01 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 02 · LESSON 02 · ABOUT 28 MIN</span><h3>Japanese vowel words and their meanings</h3><p>Build simple syllables, learn useful picture-card words, distinguish あお/あおい and いえ/いいえ, and try 14 interactive checks.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-02/lesson-02/">Study Chapter 02 lesson 02 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 02 · LESSON 03 · ABOUT 30 MIN</span><h3>Vowel length, mora timing and meaning</h3><p>Learn why a held vowel changes a word, count written morae, and apply short/long contrasts in 12 interactive checks.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-02/lesson-03/">Study Chapter 02 lesson 03 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 02 · LESSON 04 · ABOUT 29 MIN</span><h3>Recognize and type Japanese sound symbols</h3><p>Review vowel pairs, read the k-row and さ・す・し, type kana labels and try optional ungraded copying.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-02/lesson-04/">Study Chapter 02 lesson 04 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 02 · LESSON 05 · ABOUT 27 MIN</span><h3>Read a Japanese pronunciation map</h3><p>Scan eleven original vowel and mora rows, cite written evidence, and answer twelve interactive reading questions.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-02/lesson-05/">Study Chapter 02 lesson 05 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 02 · LESSON 06 · ABOUT 27 MIN</span><h3>Hear Japanese vowel length in conversation</h3><p>Two original licensed male/female Japanese conversations, seven audio-evidenced questions, hidden transcripts and optional assisted practice.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-02/lesson-06/">Study Chapter 02 lesson 06 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 02 · LESSON 07 · ABOUT 31 MIN</span><h3>Write Japanese vowel contrasts accurately</h3><p>Type five vowel kana and meaningful short/long pairs, check ten written answers, build four context labels and self-review two original Japanese lines.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-02/lesson-07/">Study Chapter 02 lesson 07 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 02 · LESSON 08 · ABOUT 29 MIN</span><h3>Speak Japanese vowels with natural timing</h3><p>Shadow two real conversations with precise turn playback, practise vowel-length contrasts, optionally record privately and self-review without an artificial pronunciation grade.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-02/lesson-08/">Study Chapter 02 lesson 08 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 02 CHECKPOINT · ABOUT 25 MIN</span><h3>Japanese sound system — mixed checkpoint</h3><p>Review five vowels and written mora timing with twelve original questions, then answer four meaning-based questions from two real AivisSpeech conversations.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-02/checkpoint/">Take Chapter 02 checkpoint ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 03 · LESSON 01 · ABOUT 22 MIN</span><h3>Sound changes and rhythm: meaning in context</h3><p>Read Mika and Haru’s picture-card scene, contrast vowel length, small っ and ん, and answer twelve written questions.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-03/lesson-01/">Study Chapter 03 lesson 01 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 03 · LESSON 02 · ABOUT 24 MIN</span><h3>Useful Japanese sound-contrast words</h3><p>Recognize meaningful long vowels, small っ and nasal ん in family terms, stamps, books and everyday vocabulary with eight interactive checks.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-03/lesson-02/">Study Chapter 03 lesson 02 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 03 · LESSON 03 · ABOUT 24 MIN</span><h3>Sound changes in Japanese sentences</h3><p>Interpret eight original written sentence-context questions about meaningful long vowels, small っ, and nasal ん, with answer feedback and local progress.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-03/lesson-03/">Study Chapter 03 lesson 03 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 03 · LESSON 04 · ABOUT 28 MIN</span><h3>Write Japanese sound-change kana</h3><p>Recognize and type long vowels, small っ and nasal ん with twelve scored Japanese-script questions and detailed explanations.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-01/chapter-03/lesson-04/">Study Chapter 03 lesson 04 ↗</a></div><p class="foundation-next-up">Up next in the blueprint: <strong>L0-M01-C03-L05 — Sound-change reading practice.</strong> In development.</p></div></section>
</Base>
